funny. What was funny about it? I can see why it was interesting or why it was curious, but I understand that when you and I must work together, there was just endless amounts of hilarity. There was a lot of laughter. And you know, what was what was fun was finding yourself fun was finding yourself about to say something really stupid and you know having and sort of holding, holding back because you know better but it's that impulse to say things that you know that are without basis or that are purely associated and really it doesn't matter't matter how intelligent you are, or how educated you are. There are those intuitions,

